 "That receipt reported IC02's join as 7.2 ms, taken from ic02-diag's per-step
  table, and concluded ~40 ms of the query was 'somewhere other than clause
  joining or planning'. That was wrong. ic02-diag REIMPLEMENTS the two join
  strategies from arrangement's primitives -- its own caveat says so -- and its
  step timings are not the engine's. Measured through the engine, the join is
  the cost."

