 :findings
 ["The join is ~96 ms. Planning is 1.7 ms and the harness's top-20 is 3.0 ms.
   IC02's cost is inside `datalog.core/q`, joining three clauses to produce 995
   rows over 409,877 quads."
  "CLAUSE ORDER IS NOT THE LEVER. Planned order 95.573 ms, source order 97.317 ms
   -- a 1.8% difference. This explains, rather than merely records, why the
   2026-08-02 attempt to make IC02 faster by changing how the join groups its
   work moved the number the wrong way three runs running: there is very little
   ordering headroom in this query to begin with."]

 :guard-that-caught-the-previous-attempt
 "The first version of this probe reported plan 0.136 ms and execute 0.810 ms --
  a spectacular-looking result. It also printed `rows 0`: `build-kotobase`
  returns `{:db .. :quads ..}` and the probe had passed the whole map as the db,
  so every query matched nothing. This version aborts with exit 2 when the row
  count is zero, rather than printing timings of an empty answer."

 :next
